/// The 32 KPIs of the spec catalogue: 12 landing cards (card_order 1-12) + 20 bench KPIs (More KPIs drawer). Attributes group / lever / horizon / owner / statement drive the Filters menu (E-53). Joins no fact. Derived on load: domain_order, owner_cadence.
